* LD4_RECT_model.lib -- two interchangeable implementations of the same
* LD4_RECT_MODEL subckt (same name + pin interface in every section):
*   ideal  : single ideal inductor, L=8.4824n
*   rl     : EM-derived series L+R, L=8.4824n R=30.2594ohm
* Select the active one from the including file via:
*   .lib <path>/LD4_RECT_model.lib ideal   (or rl)
*
* Rectangular reshape of LD4 (N=3, W=2um, S=2um, SC2 stack tier -- TM+M4 shunted
* via real TV via-stitching across the whole trace; distinct from LD2's
* nostack/TM-only N=3/W=1.75 family), outer half-extents (outer_half_x,
* outer_half_y) = (216.0, 93.0) -> rx=232.0, ry=109.0 (ry shrunk from the
* square's 166.0, rx grown to compensate and conserve L). EM verified via
* openEMS (gds2openEMS, PEC boundaries, energy_limit=-60dB, resonance_estimation,
* 2.4GHz, OPENEMS-GF180MCUD-1P5M-TM11KA-MIMB-STACKED2.xml): L=8.4824nH (+0.50%
* vs the square's 8.4401nH/8.44nH target), R=30.2594ohm (+3.88% vs 29.13ohm --
* secondary, LD4 is intentionally lossy by design), Q=4.227 (-3.3%). Confirmed
* on the first candidate, no correction iteration needed.
* Floorplan motive: this coil is chained immediately east of L1 in build_cg and
* was the sole driver pinning MACRO_W at 1186 (east edge cx4+166=1151, plus a
* now-removed dedicated vdd column that pinned it further to 1186); the smaller
* ry brings its east edge to ~1037, under LSHUNT_OUT's own 1044 floor.
* See /foss/designs/rapidpassives/try4/newflow/good_tries/LD4_RECT_CAND1_X216.0_Y93.0_N3_W2_SC2/
* (STATUS.md) for the full derivation.

.lib ideal
.SUBCKT LD4_RECT_MODEL p1 p2
L1 p1 p2 8.4824n
.ENDS LD4_RECT_MODEL
.endl ideal

.lib rl
.SUBCKT LD4_RECT_MODEL p1 p2
R1 p1 mid_LD4_RECT 30.2594
L1 mid_LD4_RECT p2 8.4824n
.ENDS LD4_RECT_MODEL
.endl rl
